IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bsa-bills`

-- Bills of Sale Act 1886, ss 2 to 13 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_bills-of-sale-act-1886.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`the compliant loan bill` MEANS `Security bill` WITH
